  "_about": "Every natural thing of the game and what it is made of: its code, the share of each primordial (firmo is terra, aqua água, aura ar, igni fogo). There is no recipe to match: any mixture is matter, and one near a thing's code (within 5 points of each share) shows as that thing (docs/plano-materia-emergente.md). The four primordials and the fusions the book teaches are known; every other code is found by trying. 'unit' is the UMU one block holds in any state; a block holds the unit, an item a ninth of it unless it says its own 'umu'. A gas or a plasma with no forms shows as the nearest state that has some; a solid or a liquid with none is formless matter.",
